---
description: Secure, responsive FiveM NUI and React/Vite or Svelte build conventions
alwaysApply: false
---
Use a correctly built ui_page asset directory and relative Vite base. Send client-to-browser messages via SendNUIMessage and register browser-to-client callbacks with RegisterNUICallback; always call cb in every path. Use GetParentResourceName in the NUI browser, avoid inline secrets and close focus on resource stop.
